{"title":"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the lines with equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/4/ec459d1db5b108bf8e5eb8d912810eb161f12111.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x + 6y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/e/3ae98003b1a3914a89d3d3d27607599163edf2b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x + ky = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> are parallel, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For two lines to be parallel, their slopes must be equal to each other. \n</p><p>From the first line, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c724f60a1c85c774433facc97a6fc97f7a45a980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6y = 5 - 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/e/06e609a4cb4ef13450fd94a83f4c08380451625c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{5 - 4x}{6} = \\frac{-4}{6}x + \\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"188\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8029b29bb1ae162ebe5f59bf643969911bae6d0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{-2}{3}x + \\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>From the second line, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a2ea4103db0cda961cffa6fee02bc6782e409e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ky = 3 - 6x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/44881e77c09b61224b8a6ede5df8a35e70c24c5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{3 - 6x}{k} = \\frac{-6}{k}x + \\frac{3}{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"189\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>We then see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/2/f622d80678f4d018fa85167780c8eeb6edd4077d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-6}{k} = \\frac{-2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f22c1d9778f865b045492229a727769ae612a261.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-2}{3}k = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c39f71c241934d6f87c72ca94875a945497e08e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = -6 \\times \\frac{3}{-2} = \\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"153\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230415\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2139/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.815      1 2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.815      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36051:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230415 and revision id 281365. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}